	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Teeeeeei!”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Her sharp voice cuts through the crisp air of the dojo.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"Hotori steps in towards me at the same time, and I barely manage to turn her blade away.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Kh?!”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"The sound of wood on wood echoes through the dojo as Hotori takes her distance.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"But she only pulls back for a split second to fix her stance before pressing her attack once more.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Haaaah!”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"But her attack still comes a moment too slow.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"I twist my body and sidestep her slash entirely.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ah...?!”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"As she staggers to try and regain her balance, I send her flying.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Aaaahh!”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"She tumbles across the room and lands on her backside on the hard dojo floor.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"Not a second later, I bring the tip of my wooden blade right to her throat.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"Game, set, match.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What's the matter? It's not like you to react so slowly.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"I ask as I offer Hotori my hand.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"Her bladework is uncharacteristically sloppy.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"Frankly speaking, it seems like she's hardly trying.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Is there anything on your mind?”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“N-No, not really.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"Hotori mutters before trailing off.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"But the moment I try to take her hand─",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“S-Stay back!”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"She recoils away with terrifying vigor.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"Her unexpected behavior catches me completely off guard.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ah...?!”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"Hotori's own eyes grow wide, as though even she's startled by her own actions.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“S-Sorry. But, um... we still can't!”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"Still sitting on the floor, she frantically backpedals away.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"She's clearly acting out of the ordinary.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Seriously, what's the matter?”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I-I'm, uh, sweaty right now!”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We're close enough to be past caring about that, aren't we?”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Still, no means no!”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ah, it's almost time for school! I'm gonna go back and get changed, okay?!”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"Hotori scrabbles up her things and dashes out of the dojo before I can get a word in edgewise.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"...What in the world is up with her?",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"Left all alone, I ponder to myself.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"Even at school, Hotori acts just as odd as she did this morning.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Haah...”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"Even after today's lessons come to an end, Hotori remains seated, slumping her shoulders.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"I can't help but be worried, so I move to sneak a peek at her face.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hyaaaah!”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"When Hotori notices me, she nearly leaps out of her seat.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"She coughs to try and disperse the gazes of all the people around us.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"But she soon assumes her usual pout and glares up at me.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Don't sneak up on me like that!”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I wasn't really sneaking.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"I just walked up to her like a normal person.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Well, okay, then.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“No, it's still not okay. Don't come any closer!”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Well, if that's what you want, I'll keep my distance.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"I can't hide the disappointment in my voice, and Hotori's expression turns apologetic.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“U-Um, it's not that I don't want you to or anything...”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's fine. Don't worry about it.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"Her intentions are a mystery, but if it's what she wants, then that's what I'll do.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"When I put some distance between us, Hotori lets out a sigh of relief and takes her seat.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"Kotone, who's been watching us with concern the whole time, walks up to Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hotori-sama, whatever might be the matter?”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Don't worry about me...”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"Hotori listlessly croaks out a reply.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"Following Kotone's lead, Akari and Shino also start gathering around her.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Inou, are you feeling a bit tired?”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Or did Soujin screw up somehow?”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's not like that.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"Hotori steals a glance at me as she replies.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Hah ha. I know what this is. It's that classic cooling-off period.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Cooling-off?”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"Shino smugly alternates looking between me and Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“These two go way back, so they already know all there is to know 'bout each other.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“And now it's biting them in the butt. Who'da thunk they'd get tired of each other so quickly?”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I'll betcha Soujin started it by giving her his usual standoffish treatment.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin...?!”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Wait, that can't be right at all.”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"I reflexively flinch at the inexplicable intensity exuding from Akari.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"Besides, if we're talking about being standoffish, I'd think she was describing Hotori's recent behavior.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Go on, Inou, tell him what's up.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh, where'd she go?”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"She vanished without a trace right under our eyes.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“She said that she was going home alone and departed the classroom.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"Akari fixes me with a withering gaze.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Listen here, Soujin. If you dump Inou, I'm never gonna forgive you.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Rest assured. I won't.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"But even with that said, I still don't have a clue what could possibly be on Hotori's mind.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"After a meeting at the Sworn Blades' headquarters, I call out to Hotori.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"Everyone else has long since left already.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Wh-What?”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"Hotori leaps up with a start.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are you alright?”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“O-Of course! I'm the very picture of alright-ness!”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"She seemed somewhat out of it during the meeting.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"With our battle against the Republican Army intensifying, Hotori losing her spirit will affect the morale of all the warriors.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If anything's bothering you, I want you to tell me about it.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“There's nothing bothering me. I'm just a little tired.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Do you think I can't tell? Don't lie to me.”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"We've already become one in both body and soul.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"That I can see through her white lies should go without saying.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I guess there's no use trying to hide it from you.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"Hotori lets out a long sigh.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Anything at all. Won't you please tell me?”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"Hesitating all the while, Hotori starts talking bit by bit.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I can't continue to be a warrior any longer.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“At this rate, I'll never be able to face our comrades who are no longer with us.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What are you talking about? You're doing a great job of leading the Sworn Blades as our Executor.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"Under Hotori's leadership, the hearts of all our members are united as one.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"The day we finally retake the Empire is drawing near. It's so close I can taste it.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That's not true at all. The way I've been acting... I'm a total failure!”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"She roughly shakes her head, mussing up her beautiful hair.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's already too late! The only choice I have is death!”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"She reaches for her hip to try and draw Shiranui.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Wait! Calm down!”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"I desperately grab her hands.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Don't stop me, Soujin!”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm a failure! This is the only way out!”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"Hotori cries out with tragic determination.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm a dirty, perverted girl! My only choice is death!”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“As soon as I see your face, I can't stop thinking lewd thoughts for the whole rest of the day!”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Calm down, Hotori. You're not making any sense.”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ooh...”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"As I gently soothe her, Hotori seems to calm down a little.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Lately, in every one of my waking thoughts, even my dreams, all I can think about is you!”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Um... It's been this way ever since we started doing... certain things...”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"Hotori gingerly rubs her thighs together as she says “certain things.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“My body starts burning up the moment you so much as touch me.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That's why back at school, and even right now, I've been desperately trying to get you out of my head.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"I never would have thought I was the source of her troubles.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's all my fault you had to feel so bad. I'm sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's not bad at all!”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"She objects in a voice so loud that even she seems startled by it, her face turning a deep shade of red.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's not... bad...”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But I'm so ashamed of myself for wanting you to touch me more and more.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hey, Soujin. You don't hate me now, do you?”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"She looks at me with upturned eyes.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Never.”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Do you really mean it?”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I really do.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"I can't stop the bemused grin from spreading across my face.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Jeez! I'm seriously worried over here!”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hahaha, sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I've actually been the same way.”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"Hotori blinks in confusion.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“My head's been full of nothing but you.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You too?”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah. Every waking and dreaming moment, you're all I can think about.”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So hearing that you feel the same way makes me happy.”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"I embrace Hotori as she continues looking at me with upturned eyes.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"I want her, here and now.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“W-We can't! This is the Sworn Blades headquarters, you know?”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"She struggles inside my arms, but her heart is clearly not in it.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you don't want to, you can throw me off at any time.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Y-You know I wouldn't do that!”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"I bring my face towards hers, and Hotori no longer even pretends to resist.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"She gently closes her eyes.",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"I bring my lips to hers, and they gently come together.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Mm...”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"Her soft lips overlap with mine.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"That alone sets all my insides smoldering with desire.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"But it's still not enough.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Mm, nmmm...”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"Hotori starts seeking out my lips with hers.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"After we fill ourselves up with each other's taste, I reluctantly pull my face away.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If just being touched by me is enough to set you off, the only cure is for me to do it so much that you get used to it, right?”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Oh... You jerk...”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"Hotori gently sits down on my lap, her gaze unable to meet mine.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"Our faces are close enough to tickle each other with our breathing, and each breath we take stirs up both of our feelings.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"I peel Hotori's clothes off and run my hands across her soft skin.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"I gently caress her sweat-streaked cheeks and lovingly comb the locks of stray hair behind her ears.",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori, I'm sorry I got so rough.”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's fine...”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"Still wearing a vacant expression, she slowly shakes her head in response.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You're normally so gentle with me, so when it's just the two of us, it's alright if you want to have your way with me.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“And besides, even when you're so rough, um... I really\ndon't mind it...”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"Her face flushes redder and redder as she confesses that to me.",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"It makes her look all the more lovable, and I find myself once more tightly wrapping my arms around her.",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori, you don't ever need to agonize over things all on your own.”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Yeah,.. I'm done worrying about it.”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"Hotori declares in a refreshingly clear voice.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I love you, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“There's no way that I can keep back all these feelings I have for you!”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Whenever I want to kiss you, I won't hold back anymore.”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Whenever I want you to embrace me, I'll be honest about it!”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			{
"She proclaims without any reservations.",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...Isn't that a little too straightfoward?”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"I imagine her boldly clinging to me in front of all the other warriors.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Don't worry so much. I won't forget the proper time and place, of course.”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Or, could it be?”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			{
"She peers into my eyes with a grin.",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You wanna be able to kiss me anywhere and anytime in order to show off to someone?”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Listen, you.”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hehehe, juuust kidding.”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I belong to you and you alone.”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'd never let anyone else see me like this.”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			{
"She shows me her brightest smile yet.",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			{
"That's the bright, cheerful Hotori that I'm used to. The girl that nobody else but me knows.",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin...”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"Hotori brings her face close and gently brushes her lips against mine.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"Seeing that radiant smile of hers, I feel my love for her deepen even further.",
			},
